OL,3,GNEWSAGreyhound Derby to remain at
OL,4,ATowcester Racecourse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA racecourse has been given the
OL,7,Fcontract to host the annual English
OL,8,FGreyhound Derby for the next five
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FTowcester Racecourse, in
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire, added it was "the
OL,13,Fhome of the sport's biggest fixture"
OL,14,Fwhich next year celebrates its
OL,15,Fcentenary.
OL,17,FLast month, it was confirmed horse
OL,18,Fracing would return to the track, after
OL,19,Fit closed for the sport in 2019 when
OL,20,FTowcester Racecourse Company Limited
OL,21,Fentered into administration with debts
OL,22,Fof more than #1.3m.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
