OL,3,GNEWSAGreyhound Derby to remain at
OL,4,ATowcester Racecourse
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreyhound racing is due to be banned in
OL,7,FScotland and Wales. Campaign group
OL,8,FAnimal Rising has protested against the
OL,9,Fracing of dogs at Towcester arguing
OL,10,Fthat it was "dangerous", but the sports
OL,11,Fnational board said it was a
OL,12,F"welfare-driven" sport.
